    <div class="tour-main">
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Escape to mainland Tanzania for a thrilling day safari. Fly from Zanzibar to either Mikumi National Park (famous for the "S" curve of the river) or Nyerere National Park (formerly Selous Game Reserve, vast wetlands and wildlife). Return the same evening.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>What to Expect</h2>
        <ul class="expect-list">
      <li>Morning flight from Zanzibar to Mwanza or Dar es Salaam (chartered, 1.5 hours)</li>
      <li>4-hour game drive in 4x4 with a licensed Tanzanian guide</li>
      <li>Park fees, lunch, and refreshments included</li>
      <li>Evening return flight to Zanzibar</li>
      <li>Spot elephants, lions, hippos, crocodiles, giraffes, and over 400 bird species</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Duration & Meeting Point</h2>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> Full day (8–10 hours including flights)</p>
        <p><strong>Meeting point:</strong> Abeid Amani Karume International Airport (ZNZ) — transfer from your hotel included</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Important Notes</h2>
        <ul class="notes-list">
      <li>Flight-dependent — weather permitting only</li>
      <li>Must use a licensed mainland operator (we handle this)</li>
      <li>Minimum 2 passengers for charter flights — single supplement applies</li>
      <li>Best months: June–October and December–March (dry seasons)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
